[I] Classic flying toasters 2D screensaver for XScreensaver

[T] flying-toasters is a classic flying toasters 2D screensaver recreation for
[T] XScreensaver.

[U] https://github.com/torunar/flying-toasters-xscreensaver

[A] Mikhail Shchekotov
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/x11 extra/screensaver
[F] CROSS

[E] add xscreensaver

[L] MIT
[V] 1.3.1

[D] 1393febd3c9782417ab2530134803f6ed9a862a906eeff7441613457 flying-toasters-xscreensaver-1.3.1.tar.gz https://github.com/torunar/flying-toasters-xscreensaver/archive/v1.3.1/

runmake=0
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -L$root$(pkgprefix libdir libx11)
hook_add inmake 5 '$CC $CFLAGS -o $root$bindir/flying-toasters src/flying-toasters.c -lX11 -lXpm'
